      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, left column, bottom",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>Praise to God, the lord of the [universe?].</li>\n<li>The entire portion amounting to one-quarter [of the house] was turned over</li>\n<li>[&nbsp; &nbsp;] all of the house described... [&nbsp; &nbsp;]</li>\n<li>\n<p>on the recto, by the legal [?] purchase from the private</p>\n<p>property of S\u0323afi\u0304 al-Di\u0304n Muh\u0323ammad, mentioned above,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>to the private property of the blind woman Khadi\u0304ja daugh- ter of [?] Muh\u0323ammad ibn Na\u0304s\u0323ir ibn Muh\u0323ammad ibn Sharaf [?] ibn Ya\u02bfqu\u0304b,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>the merchant in the shop that is in the Bunduqi\u0304, a legal turnover in accordance with what...</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>the contract of the same date. Witnessed on the 19th of God&rsquo;s month</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Muh\u0323arram, the year 808 [17 July 1405]. God is sufficient to us and the best disposer of affairs.</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 2
    },
