          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, right column",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>P[raise God].</li>\n<li>\n<p>The half was turned over: the portion that comprises three shares of the original 24 [shares].</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>[&nbsp; &nbsp;] the boundaries described on the recto, from the private property of Na\u0304s\u0323ir al-Di\u0304n...</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>[&nbsp; &nbsp;] ...the entire...</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>[&nbsp; &nbsp;] ...the square [?]...[&nbsp; &nbsp;]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>[&nbsp; &nbsp;] ...and one-quarter to the private property of al-H\u0323a\u0304jj Mu\u02bfammar ibn Zayn al-Di\u0304n \u02bfAli\u0304</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>in a legal turnover witnessed by it [the document]. A document was written [?] ... [&nbsp; &nbsp;]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>on the date the fourth of Shawwa\u0304l in the year 855 [7 November 1451].</p>\n</li>\n<li>[witnesses]</li></ol>\n",
